 Marks","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/stretch-marks/111331","site":"T Nation · 21 posts · 2008"},{"title":"Stretch Marks Under Arms","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/stretch-marks-under-arms/232655","site":"T Nation · 16 posts · 2017"},{"title":"Stretch Marks?","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/stretch-marks/102028","site":"T Nation · 16 posts · 2008"},{"title":"Tips for Stretch Marks?","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/tips-for-stretch-marks/166280","site":"T Nation · 13 posts · 2011"}],"news":[],"social":[],"web":[{"title":"Stretch marks - Wikipedia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stretch_marks"}]},"angle":{"goal":"Skin","chain":["Oil moisturizes skin","Skin looks more supple","Scars and stretch marks look softer"],"effect":"claimed","text":"Users massage this cosmetic oil into scars, stretch marks and uneven tone so the skin looks softer and more supple. It works as a moisturizer, and product-specific trials were not found."},"wikipedia":null,"grokipedia":null,"lead":["Bio-Oil is a commercial skincare oil marketed for improving the appearance of scars, stretch marks and uneven skin tone. It is a branded cosmetic product, not a drug.","Peer-reviewed literature on the specific product was not available to this wiki at the time of writing, so the evidence summary below is limited to what general references say about stretch marks. A Wikipedia summary reports a Cochrane systematic review finding no evidence that creams or oils prevent or reduce stretch marks in pregnancy.[1]"],"infobox":[["Type","Cosmetic skincare oil"],["Marketed for","Scars, stretch marks, uneven skin tone"],["Regulatory class","Cosmetic"]],"sections":[{"h":"Clinical studies","paras":["No studies found for the branded product in the references reviewed. Studies of other oils and creams for stretch marks are summarized in general references: the Cochrane review mentioned above found no evidence of prevention or reduction with creams or oils in pregnancy, and evidence for reducing established marks is described as limited.[1]"],"subs":[]},{"h":"Use in looksmaxxing communities","paras":["The product is discussed in skincare forums as a popular over-the-counter stretch mark and scar oil; the wiki holds no cited forum material on it."],"subs":[]}],"lore":null,"timeline":[],"refs":[{"title":"Stretch marks","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stretch_marks","source":"Wikipedia","year":2025,"type":"encyclopedia"}],"studies":[{"title":"Stretch marks","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stretch_marks","source":"Wikipedia","year":2025,"kind":null}],"reddit":[],"forums":[{"title":"Brotherhood of Iron Redux","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/brotherhood-of-iron-redux/133402","site":"T Nation · 1127 posts · 2009"},{"title":"Jake's Road to Bodybuilding","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/jakes-road-to-bodybuilding/166719","site":"T Nation · 1126 posts · 2011"},{"title":"Physique Clinic discussion for Barti","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/physique-clinic-discussion-for-barti/95603","site":"T Nation · 1005 posts · 2007"},{"title":"Women of T Nation","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/women-of-t-nation/277905","site":"T Nation · 492 posts · 2022"},{"title":"The B!tch Is Back (:","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/the-b-tch-is-back/168140","site":"T Nation · 106 posts · 2011"},{"title":"Stretch Marks Everywhere, Depressed!","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/stretch-marks-everywhere-depressed/185348","site":"T Nation · 70 posts · 2012"}]}